	(text "POWER: Eurorack +12V / -12V -> B5819W per rail -> +12V / -12V (about +/-11.6 V).\n+5V and pins 11-16 unused. 100n at every op-amp supply pin, 10u bulk per rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1f06c112-2b38-5123-aa43-eed7ecfe2d16")
	)
	(text "MIX (modules/imix): CHO n -> 100k -> SUM -> summer (100k || 20p) ->\ninverter -> 1k (2512) -> MIX. MIX = CHO1 + CHO2 + CHO3 with the input polarity.\nAll outputs 1k / 1 W 2512."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2f456f6f-2249-501f-9cc4-5f6f21028eec")
	)
	(text "CHANNEL n (n = 1..3; refs Rn01..Rn11, Cn01..Cn08, Dn01, Un01..Un04):\nevery input buffered at a fixed 100k.\nIN -> -1 buffer -> LDR + 10k -> -1 VCA stage (gain 10k / (10k + R_LDR)) -> 100R -> VOL n ->\nfollower -> 1k -> OUT n, and 100k -> SUM (OUT is post-volume).\nCV -> 100k -> -0.51 buffer (CVB) -> vactrol driver, LED in the op-amp loop:\nI_LED = 0.51 x CV / 330R, linear from 0 V.\nNo CV plug: TN normals CV to +12V via 56k (~12 mA, VCA open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "aac36d5e-ec3a-594a-a9e9-7391736edeff")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01 marks the Eurorack GND; #FLG02/#FLG03 mark the +12V/-12V rails,\nfed from the header only through D501/D502, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d19e909b-9ba5-53b8-baa3-863f373d50a4")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR VCA-MIX - S4 schematic: 3 x vactrol VCA (Bread Modular V2CA at CURVE 0, LOW/SVF vactrol driver) + post-VCA volume + 3-channel mixer (modules/imix). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e15b0072-4805-5885-a20e-2f3ef9876a84")
	)
